    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（22国考）某地引进新的杂交水稻品种，今年每亩稻谷产量比上年增加了20%，且由于口感改善，每斤稻谷的售价从1.5元提升到1.65元。以此计算，今年每亩稻谷的销售收入比上年高660元。问今年的稻谷亩产是多少斤？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1375"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1650"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1980"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "2200"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          86
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          80
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-02-p086.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 实战精刷2 · 讲义第80页",
            "pdfPage": 86
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设去年亩产x斤，今年1.2x斤。去年收入1.5x元，今年收入1.65×1.2x＝1.98x元。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "每亩收入多0.48x＝660，得到去年亩产1375斤。题目问今年，所以1.2×1375＝1650斤，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "涨价和增产共同影响收入，求出的基期产量还要换成题目所问的现期。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
