    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23国考）已知A、B两种设备定价相同，C设备单价为8000元／台。现A、B两种设备分别打六折、七折促销，购买1台B设备的费用比购买A、C设备各1台的总费用高2万元。问促销期间1000万元预算最多可以购买多少台A设备？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "35"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "51"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "59"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "77"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          86
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          80
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-03-p086.webp",
            "alt": "利润问题 · 实战精刷3 · 讲义第80页",
            "pdfPage": 86
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s08-t02-drill-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设A、B原定价P元。促销B售价0.7P，A售价0.6P；B比A加C共贵20000元，所以0.7P－0.6P－8000＝20000。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "得到P＝280000元，A促销价168000元。1000万元预算可买10000000÷168000≈59.52台。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "设备只能整台买，最多59台，选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "价格差先统一元，采购数量最后向下取整并核验预算。"
        }
      ],
